ass=\\\"bold\\\">Could</span> we have ... ?<br> What are the specials for tonight?<br></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Certainly, Sir/Madam/Miss.<br> Yes, we have ... </br> Tonight, the specials are ... <br> With pleasure.<br></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Waiter/Waitress\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Are you ready to order?<br> Would you like to start with ... ?<br> Can I get you some drinks to start?<br> Will that be all?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Yes. I'd like ... <br> I need a few more minutes.<br> Yes, thank you very much.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "napkin"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small piece of cloth you use to clean your mouth "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Can you pass me a napkin? I need to clean my mouth."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob06aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use at a restaurant."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "plate "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a flat dish used to serve food"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Look at all the food! My plate is full!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob06aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "I'm starving"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "I'm very hungry!"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Are we ready to order? I'm starving!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob06aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fork"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a utensil used to pick up food"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Could I have a fork to eat the nachos with?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob06aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "spoon"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a utensil used to scoop or measure food "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need a spoon to eat this soup!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob06aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "knife"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a utensil used to cut food "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Let's cut the cake. Do you have a knife?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob06aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tablecloth"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a large piece of cloth used to decorate a table"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This tablecloth is very pretty. Where is it from?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob06aud07"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Read the dialogue again."}, {"type": "text", "content": "With a partner, write a dialogue about ordering food at a restaurant."}, {"type": "text", "content": "If you are the customer, make polite requests."}, {"type": "text", "content": " If you are the waiter or waitress, make polite offers and ask polite questions. Remember to use proper etiquette!"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Exchange roles with your partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I use proper restaurant etiquette."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask for information 